<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that you had a negative experience with our Baggage Service during the search for your lost property in <strong>&lt;city&gt;</strong>.<br />
<br />
<strong>Personal items under your care and control</strong><br />
We do our best to make sure your journey with us is safe, and always prioritise helping you look after your belongings on board and at our airports.<br />
<br />
It’s also essential for our customers to take responsibility for their personal items while travelling, which helps us provide the best service possible.<br />
<br />
<strong>Your opinion matters to us&nbsp;</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that your feedback has been passed onto the relevant management team for their review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
